	(text "Notes:\n- GNSS_RF: 50R controlled-impedance CPWG, keep short. D1 should be very close to J1\n- Firmware settings: CFG-HW-ANT_CFG_SHORTDET=1, CFG-HW-ANT_SUP_SHORT_PIN=5, CFG-HW-ANT_CFG_PWRDOWN=1,\n  CFG-HW-ANT_CFG_RECOVER=1, CFG-HW-RF_LNA_MODE=bypass. \n- Side effect is that EXTINT is not available as an interrupt input"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
